## PHASE 1.4: STRIP TRAILING WHITESPACE

```bash
cd ~/dutchbay-epc-model

echo "=== REMOVING TRAILING WHITESPACE ==="

find analytics/ finance/ tests/ scripts/ \
  -name "*.py" \
  ! -path "*/analytics/fx/*" \
  ! -path "*/scripts/research/*" \
  ! -name "test_fx_*.py" \
  -type f \
  -exec sed -i 's/[[:space:]]*$//' {} \;

# Verify on specific files that had W293
echo ""
echo "=== CHECKING FOR REMAINING W293 (whitespace) ==="
flake8 analytics/ finance/ tests/ scripts/ --select=W293
# Should show: (no output = good)
```

