## TROUBLESHOOTING

### Black hangs on a file
```bash
# Ctrl+C to stop
# Find the problematic file
find . -name "*.py" -exec wc -c {} \; | sort -rn | head -5

# Run Black on other files first, debug the large one separately
```

### autoflake removes something important
```bash
# Undo just autoflake
git diff HEAD | grep "^-import" > /tmp/removed_imports.txt

# Review, then manually restore if needed
git checkout HEAD -- <file>
# Then edit manually
```

### isort creates unexpected changes
```bash
# Check if multi-line imports got reformatted unexpectedly
git diff HEAD | grep -A5 -B5 "^[+-].*import"

# Should only be reordering and grouping, not breaking imports
```

### Tests fail after Phase 1
```bash
# Run one failing test in isolation with full traceback
.venv311/bin/python -m pytest tests/path/to/test_file.py::test_name -vv --tb=long

# Check if it's import-related
.venv311/bin/python -c "from analytics import <module>; print('Import OK')"

# If import fails, check for circular dependencies
```

